Subject: [PATCH 087/249] fix: prevent crash when clearing the final queue

ExoPlayer can report a prospective media item index when its timeline is empty.
The lyrics target update treated that index as a valid item after the final queue was cleared and tried to read a nonexistent window.

Validate the index against the media item count before reading the current and upcoming items.
Clear the lyrics targets when no valid item exists so empty-player transitions remain safe.

