From 1987e120208003bf8268038a71ddee8838acbe2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <c@example.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 12:26:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 114/249] Keep every stream request under googlevideo's
