From 2506cfeb1d0c08d5e01a95525e0077475ee85f8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 16:20:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 209/249] Fall back to the running flavour when a release has
 no matching asset

Asking for a flavour a release does not publish found no asset, and no
asset is indistinguishable from being current - so the screen reported
that the build was already the latest and updates silently stopped.
Since core is the only flavour published in practice, turning the full
switch on was enough to do that.

Now the preferred flavour is tried first and the running one second, so
the option can only ever change which build is offered, never whether one
is found at all.

Verified by compiling coreRelease.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
